===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[run around]] [[like a chicken with its head cut off]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To act in a [[haphazard]] or [[aimless]] way; to act [[frantically]] or without [[control]].
#: ''The president doesn't know what to do. He's running around '''like a chicken with its head cut off'''.''

